; Print "You see :" and the objects lying where the actor is
;
; Prints the message "<subject> see :" and lists the objects with the holder
; AT_LOCATION at the actor's location (the first location of the record at
; ActorRecord, $B70C: the player in a location description), or "Nothing"
; (#R$9FAF). Registers IY, AF and BC are kept.
; .
; Hardware: none.
@label=ListObjectsHere
c$9F94 PUSH IY
 $9F96 PUSH AF
 $9F97 PUSH BC
 $9F98 LD HL,$B003          ; "<subject> see :"
 $9F9B CALL $72DD
@isub=LD A,AT_LOCATION
 $9F9E LD A,$FF             ; holder: lying at the location
 $9FA0 LD IY,($B70C)        ; the actor's record
 $9FA4 LD B,(IY+$10)        ; B = its location
 $9FA7 CALL $9FAF           ; list, or "Nothing"
 $9FAA POP BC
 $9FAB POP AF
 $9FAC POP IY
 $9FAE RET
